{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Unshine Arcade</strong> fuses  <strong>action-roguelite stealth-shooter</strong> gameplay with a <strong>story-driven psychological-horror mystery</strong>. </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In an abandoned arcade, you play at\u00a0an\u00a0arcade machine to earn the tickets you need to free a mysterious virtual pet trapped in the prize cabinet.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With every ticket you claim, you peel back another layer of the arcade\u2019s dark past, drawing you  toward the real reason behind the (S)Unshine Arcade's existence...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3694100/extras/f3ee61cd8909418fa76a0347fee71658.poster.avif?t=1767872259\" width=962 height=112 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3694100/extras/f3ee61cd8909418fa76a0347fee71658.webm?t=1767872259\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3694100/extras/f3ee61cd8909418fa76a0347fee71658.mp4?t=1767872259\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Sneak past various enemy types, find upgrades,  and <i><strong>fire back</strong></i>\u00a0</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3694100/extras/57d27b1f7a82a13f9aa7b81efda3eff4.poster.avif?t=1767872259\" width=800 height=282 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3694100/extras/57d27b1f7a82a13f9aa7b81efda3eff4.webm?t=1767872259\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3694100/extras/57d27b1f7a82a13f9aa7b81efda3eff4.mp4?t=176787